.PS
scale=2.54
arrowwid=0.08
arrowht=0.1
YAXIS: arrow up 4
XAXIS: arrow right 5 from YAXIS.c
CORNERS: box invis wid 4 with .n at XAXIS.c
FCURVE: spline from CORNERS.sw to CORNERS.n + (0, CORNERS.ht/3) to CORNERS.se
"$x$" at XAXIS.e + (0,0.2) ljust
"$x*$" at CORNERS.n + (0,0.2)
"$F(x,N,0) ^ $" at YAXIS.n + (-0.1,0.1)  rjust
.PE
